ease candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy.\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release in the deployment history. All three regions now run v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2) is open, and the on-call engineer has been paged. It explains the failure, the rollback and the result. It also notes that the cause of the v2.3.1 problem needs to be found before anyone deploys it again.", "type": "text"}]}]}